# Statistical Methods and Applications Using Quantiles (SMAQ)

## R Code Repository

This repository contains the R code used to reproduce analyses, figures, tables, and simulations from the book

**Statistical Methods and Applications Using Quantiles**  
Marco Geraci

The material is provided for research, educational, and scholarly purposes.

